		"name": "Energy Communities API",
		"description": "Enixi Laravel challenge. Import this collection together with the matching environment file, run `make install` first so the seeded data (see database/seeders/DatabaseSeeder.php) exists, then run the four \"Login as ...\" requests once each \u2014 their test scripts write the returned token into the environment. Every other request references a role-specific {{..._token}} variable and IDs from the seeded dataset.",
