								"{{energy_community_sonnenweide_id}}",
								"activate"
							]
						},
						"description": "BR-12: fails as seeded \u2014 Sonnenweide's only registration is still `new`, not an accepted generation registration. Accept the registration first (see Registrations folder) to see this succeed instead."
